398 - Bread of the World
 / 
Key: Eb
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 398
Topic: Doctrines - 

Verse 1:
[Eb]Bread of the [Ab/C]world [Eb/Bb]in [Ab]mercy [Bb]broken,
[Cm]Wine of the [Gm]soul in [Ab]mercy [Eb]shed,
[Eb]By whom the [Ab/C]words [Eb/Bb]of [Ab]life are [Bb]spoken,
[Ab]And in whose [Eb/Bb]death our [Bb7]sins are dead;

Verse 2:
[Eb]Look on the [Ab/C]heart [Eb/Bb]by [Ab]sorrow [Bb]broken,
[Cm]Look on the [Gm]tears by [Ab]sinners [Eb]shed;
[Eb]And be Thy [Ab/C]feast [Eb/Bb]to [Ab]us the [Bb]token
[Ab]That by Thy grace [Eb/Bb]our souls [Bb7]are fed. Amen.
